# 29. Question AWS extrêmement probable

> **How would you make your fraud detection API highly available?**

### Réponse modèle

> I would deploy multiple instances of the service across availability zones behind a load balancer. I would make the application stateless so instances can be added or removed horizontally. I would also monitor latency and error rates and use autoscaling based on workload. For stateful components, I would use managed highly available services where appropriate and design explicit fallback mechanisms for critical dependencies.

